          "number": 9,
          "letter": "I",
          "english": "Marconi placed a permanent stamp on the way we live. He was the first person to imagine a practical application for the wireless spectrum, and to develop it successfully into a global communication system—in both terms of the word; that is, worldwide and all-inclusive. He was able to do this because of a combination of factors—most important, timing and opportunity—but the single-mindedness and determination with which he carried out his self-imposed mission was fundamentally character-based; millions of Marconi's contemporaries had the same class, gender, race, and colonial privilege as he, but only a handful did anything with it. Marconi needed to achieve the goal that was set in his mind as an adolescent; by the time he reached adulthood, he understood, intuitively, that in order to have an impact he had to both develop an independent economic base and align himself with political power. Disciplined, uncritical loyalty to political power became his compass for the choices he had to make.",
          "chinese": "马可尼永久地改变了我们的生活方式。他是第一个设想出无线电频谱的实际用途，并成功地将其发展为全球通信系统的人——这里的“全球”同时具有两个含义，即遍及全世界且包罗万象。他之所以能够做到这一点，是因为多种因素的共同作用，其中最重要的是时机和机会；但他以专注和决心完成自我赋予的使命，根本上源于他的性格。马可尼的数百万同时代人拥有与他相同的阶级、性别、种族和殖民特权，但只有少数人利用这些条件做成了什么。马可尼需要实现那个在他少年时期便已在脑海中确立的目标；成年后，他凭直觉明白，要产生影响，他必须同时建立独立的经济基础，并使自己与政治权力保持一致。对政治权力自律而不加批判的忠诚，成为他作出各种选择时的指南针。",
